      steps: [
        "For A, the main diagonal is 1, 1, 1 and all other entries are zero.",
        "For B, the main diagonal is 1, 2, 1.",
        "The 2 in B violates the identity-matrix condition.",
        "Therefore A is I₃."
      ],
